{"stories": [{"title": "Validate NOSS Header Table Structure Compliance Across All 20 CoCu Files", "priority": "high", "description": "Scan all 20 CoCu markdown files to verify header tables conform to NOSS standard format: program code, unit level, unit title, work activity count, unit code, and page references. Generate compliance report with malformed headers and missing fields.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Script reads content/IT-020-{3,4,5}/*.md and extracts first table (header table) from each file", "Validates presence of all 6 required columns: Program Code, Unit Level, Unit Title, Work Activity Count, Unit Code, Page References", "Generates output/noss-header-format-audit.json with structure_valid (true/false), missing_columns (array), malformed_rows (line_numbers), file_path for each violation", "Exit code 1 if any violations found, 0 if 100% format compliant"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Generate JPK Submission Manifest with Compliance Checklist PDF", "priority": "high", "description": "Create automated submission checklist documenting all 25+ NOSS compliance requirements verified across 20 CoCu files. Output JPK-ready manifest as PDF with checkbox verification status, file inventories, and remediation paths for any gaps.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Run: uv run scripts/generate_jpy_manifest.py → creates output/jpy-submission-manifest.pdf", "PDF includes: project summary, 25+ compliance requirements with pass/fail status, file inventory (all 20 CoCu files listed), contact hour reconciliation, assessment criteria coverage", "Manifest references all generated output files (docx, json, audit reports) and indicates readiness for JPK submission", "Generate accompanying output/jpy-manifest-data.json with machine-readable checklist status (requirement_id, name, status: pass/fail/pending, evidence_file, notes)"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Extract and Index All Code/CLI Command Examples Across All CoCu Files", "priority": "medium", "description": "Parse all CoCu markdown files to extract code snippets, command examples, and CLI commands embedded in procedures and labs. Create searchable command reference database with syntax, prerequisites, expected output, and error handling.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Parse all content/IT-020-*/[*].md files extracting code blocks (```language blocks and inline `commands`)", "Generate output/command-reference-index.json with structure: {command, language, context_cocu, line_number, syntax, prerequisites, expected_output, common_errors}", "Create output/command-reference-guide.md (sortable by command, language, CoCu) with 100+ searchable entries", "Generate HTML version: output/command-reference-search.html with JavaScript filter by language/CoCu/keyword"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Generate Cross-Level Learning Prerequisite Graph in GraphML Format", "priority": "medium", "description": "Extract all learning outcomes from L3→L4→L5 CoCu files and model prerequisite dependencies. Output machine-readable prerequisite graph showing which L3 competencies enable L4 units and which L4 units enable L5 specialization.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Parse learning outcome matrices from all 20 CoCu files extracting competency statements and dependencies", "Generate output/prerequisite-graph.graphml (GraphML XML format) with nodes (CoCu units), edges (prerequisite relationships), edge labels (skill_bridged, confidence_score)", "Create output/prerequisite-analysis.json with: level_3_units, level_4_prerequisites (map each L4 unit to required L3 units), level_5_prerequisites (map each L5 unit to required L4 units)", "Embed visual version in generate_docx.py to add Prerequisite Map page to L4 and L5 .docx outputs"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Create Printable Quick Reference Cards (A6 Study Cards) for Each CoCu Unit", "priority": "low", "description": "Generate print-friendly A6-sized (105mm × 148mm) study cards for each CoCu with essential concepts, key terms, procedures, and learning outcomes. Optimize for flashcard printing and mobile-first digital reference.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Generate output/quick-ref-cards/{cocu_name}-qrc.pdf with A6 format (landscape 2-per-page printer layout)", "Each card includes: CoCu unit name, 3-5 key learning outcomes, 5-7 essential terms with definitions, 1-2 critical procedures, contact hour allocation", "Create output/quick-ref-cards-digital.html with HTML5 mobile-responsive version of all cards (swipe navigation)", "Include in generate_docx.py as optional appendix: --include-qrc-reference appends QRC index page to .docx"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Validate Image Metadata and Alt Text Compliance for All Generated DOCX Files", "priority": "medium", "description": "Audit all images embedded in generated .docx files for accessibility and metadata. Verify alt text presence, relevance, conciseness, image resolution, compression, and WCAG 2.1 AA compliance.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Scan output/*.docx files extracting all embedded images and metadata using python-docx", "Validate: all images have alt text, alt text ≤ 125 characters, no alt text = 'image' or 'picture' (generic), image resolution ≥ 150 DPI for quality", "Generate output/image-accessibility-audit.json with: image_name, cocu_file, alt_text_present (bool), alt_text_content, alt_text_quality (good/fair/poor), dpi, size_bytes, violations (array)", "Flag violations with: severity, remediation (add alt text, improve description, reduce file size), exit code 1 if critical violations"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Generate Student Mastery Certificates and Competency Badge Templates", "priority": "low", "description": "Create printable and digital certificate templates for students completing each CoCu unit at mastery level (≥80%). Include competency badges in PNG/SVG format for digital portfolio and certificate PDFs for printing.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Generate output/certificates/{cocu_name}-certificate-template.pdf with: student_name (blank line), CoCu title, competency level (Proficient/Advanced/Expert), date, instructor_signature line", "Create output/badges/{cocu_name}-badge-{level}.svg (4 files: Developing, Proficient, Advanced, Expert) with program code, competency name, mastery level", "Include template variables for mail merge: {{student_name}}, {{cocu_title}}, {{mastery_level}}, {{completion_date}}, {{instructor_name}}", "Add to generate_docx.py appendix showing certificate preview and badge icons"], "estimatedComplexity": "small", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Extract and Categorize All Assessment Items by Bloom's 2023 Taxonomy Level", "priority": "medium", "description": "Parse assessment criteria sections from all 20 CoCu files to extract individual assessment items. Categorize by Bloom's 2023 level, domain (knowledge/performance), and difficulty. Create item bank suitable for quiz/test construction.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Parse assessment_criteria sections from all CoCu files extracting individual assessment items/questions", "Classify each item: blooms_level (remember/understand/apply/analyze/evaluate/create), domain (knowledge/performance), difficulty (easy/medium/hard), cocu_source, original_text", "Generate output/assessment-item-bank.json with full item database queryable by level, domain, CoCu, difficulty", "Create output/assessment-item-distribution.json showing coverage: {blooms_level → count, percentage}, {domain → count, percentage}, {difficulty → count, percentage}"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Generate Learning Management System (LMS) Import Package with xAPI Statements", "priority": "low", "description": "Create SCORM 1.2 and xAPI-compliant export package from CoCu data for import into Canvas, Moodle, Blackboard, or other LMS platforms. Include course structure, learning objectives, activities, and assessment mappings.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Generate output/lms-package-scorm.zip containing: imsmanifest.xml, course structure (CoCu → work activities → learning outcomes), metadata per SCORM 1.2 standard", "Generate output/xapi-statements-export.json with xAPI format learning records for each activity: actor (learner), verb (initialized/progressed/completed/passed/failed), object (activity/CoCu/competency)", "Include output/lms-import-guide.md with instructions for Canvas/Moodle/Blackboard import and field mappings", "Validate zip integrity and SCORM compliance before output (exit code 1 if validation fails)"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}, {"title": "Create Hardware/Software Requirement Validation Matrix Across All CoCu Units", "priority": "medium", "description": "Extract all hardware and software component requirements from key terms and tools sections of every CoCu file. Build matrix showing component usage across units, version requirements, and EOL status. Validate consistency and flag compatibility issues.", "acceptanceCriteria": ["Parse 'Key Terms' and 'Tools/Equipment' sections from all 20 CoCu files extracting component names, types (hardware/software), versions, specifications", "Generate output/component-requirement-matrix.xlsx with columns: component_name, type, min_version, max_version, used_in_cocu (array), count_cocu, eol_status, notes", "Validate consistency: flag conflicting version requirements across CoCu units (e.g., Windows 10 vs Windows 11), missing EOL data, components used only once (redundancy check)", "Output violations to output/component-compatibility-report.json with: component, conflict_type, affected_cocu_files, recommended_action"], "estimatedComplexity": "medium", "_source": "product-owner-spiral"}]}
